From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 11:21:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD vim-style visual yanks for terminal panes

Support character, line, and block visual selections in the focused terminal pane so users can yank rendered left-pane rows or wrapped transcript text without leaving command-mode navigation.
